        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Christmas in the Backrooms shouldn’t exist… yet here you are.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up lost in an endless maze of yellow walls and flickering lights — and someone (or <i>something</i>) wants you to celebrate. Santa has stolen the kids gifts and moved them into the Backrooms. Forty-two scattered gift boxes are the only way out. Collect them all, escape the nightmare, and try to survive long enough to beat your best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you’re not alone down here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange figures dressed for the holidays lurk in the dark. Some stalk you quietly. Some charge the moment they notice. And some… don’t follow the rules of reality at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep moving. Stay alert. Listen closely. The Backrooms never stop watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4242080/extras/f2286d4d7b5a41fe5361d93800aae1f6.poster.avif?t=1767735614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4242080/extras/f2286d4d7b5a41fe5361d93800aae1f6.webm?t=1767735614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4242080/extras/f2286d4d7b5a41fe5361d93800aae1f6.mp4?t=1767735614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏃 Fast-paced, time-trial survival horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎁 42 gifts to find in one massive, labyrinth-like level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎅 Multiple disturbing enemies inspired by holiday cheer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 Tools to keep yourself alive… if you use them wisely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😰 Traps, darkness, and constant dread around every corner</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This year, Christmas hunts you!<br><strong>Escape before the Backrooms make you disappear!</strong></p>",
